/*
  POSTAL 2 - Map Muzak (MIDI user-provided file)
  Arduino Uno + passive buzzer
  Buzzer signal -> D8, buzzer GND/negative -> GND

  Note: A passive buzzer is monophonic. This sketch uses the MIDI's
  '8-Bit Square' track and resolves overlapping notes by choosing the
  highest active pitch. It cannot reproduce the original multi-instrument
  recording exactly.
*/
